  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "FreeCell The Game",
      "description": "FreeCell The Game is a FREE classic Solitaire with a native iOS design and BEAUTIFUL CARDS.  If you like playing FreeCell or other Solitaire games on your PC, you will love FreeCell The Game as it offers SMOOTH PERFORMANCE on your device, wherever you go. \n\nAmongst all free solitary games, FreeCell The Game is very intuitive, fun to play, with clean design and LOADS EXTREMELY FAST. You don’t have to wait the game to load, just play solitary and have fun. This puzzle card game will train your brain.\n\nIf you haven’t played before classic solitare such as Klondike, TriPeaks or Spider (also known as Patience games) – don’t worry. The game is extremely easy to play as our hint feature shows you all possible moves and you can learn the rules in the matter of few games. \n\nThe Game Center is also available for you, so you can compare your high scores and best time with friends, or just to see the leaderboards.\n\nFreeCell The Game offers a free card game of solitaire.\n\nThere are two main modes:\n\n1. RANDOM DEAL - each deal is randomly generated. Some of these deals may have no solution no matter how hard you try.\n\n2. DAILY CHALLENGE - unique deal for each day. Each Daily Challenge has a solution. Some solutions are just harder to find. You can play all Daily Challenge deals for the last 3 months.\n\nThe other features of FreeCell The Game are:\n\niPhone/iPad FEATURES:\n\n • Random deals - each deal of solitaire is randomly generated. Some of these deals may have no solution no matter how hard you try but this is part of the fun ;)\n • Winnable Daily Challenge each day\n • Autocomplete\n • Hints\n • Statistics\n • Game center leaderboards\n • Custom backgrounds\n • Custom cards faces\n • Custom cards backs\n • Custom deck spots\n • Left/Right hand layout\n • Double tap - play Solitaire with one hand\n • Game saved and restored when solitary is interrupted\n\nAPPLE WATCH FEATURES:\n\n • Left/Right hand layout\n • Statistics\n • Sounds\n • Autocomplete\n • Undo\n • Custom backgrounds\n\nYou can contact us anytime using support@mobishape.com. We appreciate a lot your feedback about FreeCell The Game solitaire and we'd like to create the best possible version of that classical card game.\n\nPlay FreeCell solitaire free and have fun :)",
      "releaseNotes": "• We dealt out a few fixes and improvements for a smoother game.\n\nThank you for your support and feedback! Let us know which features do you want most at support@mobishape.com",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/freecell-the-game/id1542504101?uo=4",
